  "description": "Server-side paging, sorting and filtering for the Inandu Grid components (@inandu-solutions/grid-angular, grid-react and grid-vue). A dependency-free ToInanduGrid() LINQ extension that turns an inandu-grid serverSide request into a single page of data plus the total count — with DTO projection, an advanced-filter (nested AND/OR) bridge and server-side grouping. Targets .NET 8 and .NET 10.",
